flowchart TD
  Agent[Agent requests action] --> Classify[Classify risk]
  Classify --> Low{Low risk?}
  Low -- Yes --> Execute[Execute and log]
  Low -- No --> MedHigh{Medium or high risk?}
  MedHigh -- Medium --> Policy[Check policy and budget]
  MedHigh -- High --> Approval[Require user approval]
  Policy --> NeedsApproval{Approval required?}
  NeedsApproval -- No --> Execute
  NeedsApproval -- Yes --> Approval
  Approval --> Approved{Approved?}
  Approved -- Yes --> Execute
  Approved -- No --> Block[Block action]
  Execute --> Audit[Audit log]
  Block --> Audit
  Audit --> Memory[Memory update if relevant]
